instrukt: todos need the project's code on GitHub: the remote `origin` (https://gitlab.com/acme/demo.git) is not a GitHub repository on github.com and `github.repository` is not set; when the remote reaches a GitHub repository through an address that does not read as one, name it with `github.repository: <owner>/<repo>` in the project's instrukt.yaml
